19.
Role and responsibilities of property manager.
- The functions of the property manager may include the following,-
(a)
collection of rent against receipt;
(b)
getting essential repairs done on behalf of the landlord;
(c)
inspection of the premises from time to time;
(d)
giving notices to tenant(s) for
(i)
proper maintenance of the premises,
(ii)
delay in payment of rent;
(iii)
revision of rent;
(iv)
vacation of premises;
(v)
renewal of tenancy;
(e)
help in resolution of disputes among tenants and between landlord and tenant(s);
(f)
any other matters relating to tenancy.
